    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Hunt Breakfast\nWESTERN\nAIRLINES",
      "MENU\nFresh Fruit in Season\nScrambled Eggs Hampshire\nPotatoes Colbert\nSERVED FROM THE HUNT BREAKFAST CART\nHunt Breakfast\nAssorted Breakfast Meats\nand\nDanish Pastries\nMuffins\nUnder its\nprogram to provide air\ntravelers with the finest in flight dining in\nAmerica, Western Airlines has developed this exclusive service\nWester's \"Hume Breakfast\" is patermed fier the carly morning feast which is\nthe traditional climax of the English fox-hunt.\nA specially designed serving cart provides a moving buffet in the aisle to make\nindividual selection and piping hot breakfast entrees a reality for the first time\naloft. Another Western exclusive for your travel pleasure!\nCoffee\nTea\nMilk\n11",
      "SEATTLE\nTACOMA,\nPUKTLAND\nFRANCISCO\nDAKLAND\nBURBANK\nLOS ANGELES\nLONG BEACH\nSAN DIEGO\nEDMONTON\nGREAT FALLS\nHELENA\nBUTTE\nIBANO FALLS (\nPOCATELLO\nBILLINGS\nSHERIDAN\nCASPER\nSALT LAKE CITY\nLAS VEGAS\nDENVER\nST. PAUL\nSIOUX FALLS\naboard a\nWESTERN AIRLINES\nHunt Breakfast Flight\n7\nPOST CARD\n611.12%"
